// A content pattern's `expected` written as a ONE-line ''' literal (Studio's grammar roundtrip work,
// 2026-11-14). legend-engine 4.145.0's STRING is `TextBlock | String`, and a TextBlock needs a line
// break after its opening ''': `'''{}'''` lexes as three adjacent strings, and the pattern's
// grammar (expected: STRING;) refuses. servicestore-content-pattern-escapes.pure holds the forms it
// admits.
###Data
Data fixture::neg::SingleLineTripleQuote
{
  ServiceStore
  #{
    [
      {
        request:
        {
          method: POST;
          url: '/employees';
          bodyPatterns:
          [
            EqualToJson
            #{
              expected:'''{"name": "A"}''';
            }#
          ];
        };
        response:
        {
          body:
            ExternalFormat
            #{
              contentType: 'application/json';
              data: '[]';
            }#;
        };
      }
    ]
  }#
}
